# This repo is PUBLIC and is served on GitHub Pages. Anything committed here is
# readable by anyone on the internet. Secrets must never land in it.
#
# Worker secrets live in Cloudflare, set with `wrangler secret put`. The only
# copies on disk are the local development files below, which are never
# committed and never uploaded by wrangler.

# Local Worker development secrets. Holds CLIENT_SECRET.
.dev.vars
worker/.dev.vars
.env
worker/.env
*.env

# Generated tokens. Holds ADMIN_TOKEN.
.tokens.local
worker/.tokens.local
*.local

# Wrangler state
.wrangler/
worker/.wrangler/

node_modules/
worker/node_modules/

# Generated catalog snapshots, can be large and go stale
catalog-live.json
worker/catalog-live.json

# Run artifacts from tools/audit-cw-tags.mjs and tools/fix-cw-tags.mjs. The
# audit is a full product dump, and the plan and rollback files are per-run
# state. Keep the rollback files on disk until you are happy with a run, they
# are the undo. They just do not belong in a public repo.
cw-tag-audit.json
cw-tag-plan-*.json
cw-tag-rollback-*.json

.DS_Store

# Supplier data files must never be committed to this public repo
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv

# Run artifacts from tools/fix-saucony-sizes.mjs
saucony-size-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/fix-saucony-unisex-sizes.mjs
saucony-unisex-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/add-saucony-missing-variants.mjs
saucony-variants-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/backfill-saucony-barcodes.mjs
saucony-barcode-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/backfill-saucony-skus.mjs
saucony-sku-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/set-shoe-weights.mjs
shoe-weight-rollback-*.json

# Brooks barcodes. The feed is generated from the supplier UPC workbook by
# tools/build-brooks-barcode-feed.py and holds barcodes only, no pricing, but it
# is 1.6 MB of derived supplier data and regenerating it is one command, so it
# does not belong in a public repo. The rollback file is per-run undo state.
brooks-barcode-feed.json
brooks-barcode-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/activate-needham-variants.mjs. The rollback file holds
# the inventory level ids created, which is the undo. Keep it on disk until the
# run is confirmed good; it does not belong in a public repo.
needham-activate-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/draft-duplicate-listings.mjs. The rollback file lists
# the products flipped from ACTIVE to DRAFT, which is the undo. Keep it on disk
# until the run is confirmed good; it does not belong in a public repo.
draft-duplicates-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from the Color Swatch stamp-specs.mjs backfill. Lists the
# products that had no specs.* before the run, which is the undo. Keep it on
# disk until the run is confirmed good; it does not belong in a public repo.
specs-backfill-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/tag-recent-products.mjs. Lists the products tagged
# and exactly what each one gained, which is the undo. Keep it on disk until the
# run is confirmed good; it names products and does not belong in a public repo.
recent-tag-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/delete-imageless-drafts.mjs. The ONLY record of
# products deleted permanently, so keep it on disk until they are recreated. It
# names products and SKUs and does not belong in a public repo.
deleted-drafts-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/publish-stocked-drafts.mjs. Lists the products taken
# from draft to live, which is the undo. Keep it on disk until the run is
# confirmed good; it does not belong in a public repo.
publish-drafts-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/set-color-attribute.mjs. The rollback file records the
# prior shopify.color-pattern value per product, which is per-run undo state and
# not something a public repo should carry.
color-attribute-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/attach-brooks-images.mjs. Lists every media id added
# to a product, which is the undo (productDeleteMedia). Per-run state, and it
# does not belong in a public repo.
brooks-media-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/refresh-asics-media.mjs. Lists the media ids added
# and deleted per product, which is the record of that repair. Per-run state.
asics-media-refresh-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/set-shoe-category.mjs. Holds each product's prior
# category, which is the undo. Per-run state, not for a public repo.
shoe-category-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/backfill-pairing.mjs. The rollback file holds every
# prior custom.* sibling value, including the ones that were absent, so it is a
# partial product dump and per-run undo state.
pairing-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/zero-location-shoes.mjs. The rollback file lists the
# per-variant quantities a location held before the reset.
falmouth-zero-rollback-*.json
location-zero-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/tag-activity.mjs. The rollback file lists every
# product and the activity tags it gained.
activity-tag-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/set-shoe-taxable.mjs. The rollback file holds the
# prior charge-tax flag for every footwear variant it touched, so it is the
# only way back from a run.
shoe-taxable-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/tag-model-families.mjs. The rollback file lists every
# product and the model: and family: tags it gained.
model-family-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/fix-duplicate-gender-titles.mjs. Holds the previous
# title of every product it rewrote, which is the undo.
title-fix-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/set-collection-images.mjs.
collection-image-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/write-model-descriptions.mjs.
description-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/fix-order-requires-shipping.mjs. Records each
# order and its prior line items before the edit, which is the record of what
# to rebuild. It names customers and does not belong in a public repo.
order-shipping-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/delete-la-import-orders.mjs. The archive is the
# ONLY record of orders deleted permanently, so keep it on disk until they are
# recreated and verified. It names customers and addresses.
la-import-archive-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/mark-revently-orders-paid.mjs.
mark-paid-before-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/create-maurten-products.mjs.
maurten-created-*.json

# Editor and tool backups, never part of the repo.
*.bak

# Run artifacts from tools/apply-product-content.mjs. Holds the previous
# description and category of every product it rewrote, which is the undo.
product-content-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/apply-sizing-block.mjs. Holds each product's whole
# previous description body, which is the only way to put it back.
sizing-block-rollback-*.json

# Run artifacts from tools/clear-bogus-specs.mjs. Holds every specs.* field it
# cleared, per product, which is the undo.
specs-clear-rollback-*.json

# CATCH ALL, and the reason it is here. Every block above was added by hand
# when its tool was written, so a tool whose pattern nobody remembered to add
# tracked its artifact into a public repo and nothing complained. Three did,
# for months. Keep writing the per-tool blocks above, they say WHY each file
# exists, but this line is what makes forgetting one harmless.
*-rollback-*.json

# tools/apparel-content.mjs caches ON's public product pages here, one per
# style, about 77 MB. It is third party marketing HTML in a PUBLIC repo and it
# is rebuildable from the sitemap in a couple of minutes, so it is never
# committed. Same reason the rollback files above are not.
on-pdp-cache/
main-menu-rollback-*.json
asics-availability.json

# Theme asset backups written by tools/enable-file-upload.mjs
product-form-backup-*.liquid
